    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34558" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμπύρ-ευμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
